// The Float @ Marina Bay (2007-2023): the 120 x 83 m steel platform floating on the bay (pontoons, six anchor pylons, three
// linkways) in front of the 27 000-seat gallery on the Marina Promenade — seat rows (red seats on grey treads) rising from the
// promenade to the 14 m back edge, aisles, the control / media booths and the floodlight masts on the top — and the Youth
// Olympic cauldron tower at the east end by the Youth Olympic Park. Re-laid on the real gallery footprint (unchanged fit).
